# Canonical Page Structure

`pages/wiseai.html` is the single source of truth for primary navigation,
spacing, padding, and module structure across the entire app. It is the only
page guaranteed to have the correct shell. Every other page must match it.

## Rules for the agent

- When creating or editing any page, copy the primary navigation and shell
  structure from `pages/wiseai.html`. Never hand-roll a variant.
- Match module container markup, padding, and margins exactly to wiseai.html.
- If `wiseai.html` and another page disagree on nav/spacing/module layout,
  `wiseai.html` wins — bring the other page into line, not the reverse.
- Preserve the shared injected nav/footer behavior (`js/marketing-shell.js`,
  `js/agent-menu.js`, `js/topbar.js`) rather than duplicating markup.

## When in doubt

Open `pages/wiseai.html`, find the equivalent structure, and mirror it.
